        "desc": "You can't go any further in these extreme weather conditions. Your face already\nsuffers from frostbite. It's numb with cold. So are your fingers. Some you can't\nmove. For a while, they have had a deep purple colour and aching. Now they feel\nwarm, but large areas are of a white colour, and small black spots appear. You\ndoubt that is a good sign. It really is very cold, it's not only the wind making\nit feel like it. The snow is dry and crispy, squeaking beneath your feet. Any\nliquid from your mouth, nose or eyes freezes instantly, and even breathing is\ntroublesome. You'll have to find shelter fast. These conditions might kill you\nwithin the end of the day, no matter how hard you struggle against them.\n",
